Claim: odd verts = {x, rho(2x)}; Eulerian (no odd verts) iff 3x=0 mod C=2n-1 iff x=C/3.
Checked 777 (n,x) pairs, n=4..40. ALL MATCH: True
=> G_x Eulerian iff x=(2n-1)/3 (exists as runner iff 3|2n-1). Euler => balanced edge
   2-coloring => silent single-flip of x => folded sign-orbit < 2^{n-2}. QED (mechanism).
